{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39976","headline":"府主仆射王[抟]生日 · 徐夤","name":"府主仆射王[抟]生日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"熊罴先兆庆垂休，天地氤氲瑞气浮。\n李树影笼周柱史，昴星光照汉酇侯。\n数锺龟鹤千年算，律正乾坤八月秋。\n勳业定应归鼎鼐，生灵岂独化东瓯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}